        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "contents": "Through My Lens\n\n[title-image]\n\nPhotography started as a way for me to slow down and notice things I'd usually walk past. A crack in a wall. The way light hits a puddle. A stranger's expression on the bus.\n\nI shoot mostly on my phone, but I've been saving up for a film camera. There's something about the limitation of 24 exposures that makes you think harder before you press the button.\n\nThese are some of my favorite shots from the past year.\n\n[image-1]\n\n[image-2]\n\n[image-3]",
